      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's a deeply painful thought, but it's also a very understandable conclusion when you've seen so much suffering. If the weight of that inherited pain feels too heavy to carry, and if you believe ending it is the only way to stop the cycle, then that thought is a clear signal of profound despair. Reaching out to a crisis line immediately can offer a different kind of immediate relief from this crushing pressure. Please connect with someone right now who can listen without judgment.",
